type project
version 1
---
# Content made at run time and loaded uncooked (docs/web-export.md is the
# cooked path; this is the other one): the game writes a glTF (a lathed
# vase with a glaze texture embedded) and a PNG (a drawing) from code, as a
# generator or a player's editor would, and loads them from their bytes
# with og.load.gltfData and og.load.imageData, within their LoadBudget, then
# draws them once each is ready. No og cook, no assets/.
name "Uncooked load"
id "uncooked-load"
engine "0.7.7"
entry "src/main.ts"
profile "3d"
tick 60
seed 1
